<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's YPF to issue $200 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>Argentina's YPF to issue $200 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's oil giant YPF Wednesday said it will issue $200 million in bonds within the next 60 days.</p>
<p>The company said in a note to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange that its board approved the issue of the bonds, which will have a maximum maturity of 15 years, as part of its $700 million bond program launched a year ago.</p>
</text>
